      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate doctors and welcoming clinic staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners across Clinton Hill praise the clinical team, noting warm bedside manner and thorough medical attention from attending doctors. Clients highlight that veterinarians listen attentively to health concerns, offer thoughtful treatment advice, and create a reassuring environment for both pets and their guardians during appointments."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 28,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle low-stress approach with companion animals"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize the staff's calm, fear-free handling of nervous dogs and sensitive cats during examinations. The veterinary team takes time to help anxious pets settle in with treats and gentle pacing, making wellness visits and routine vaccinations significantly less stressful for companion animals."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 10,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clear consultations and proactive follow-up"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently highlight responsive communication from attending doctors and reception staff. Pet owners note that veterinarians take ample time to answer questions during visits, discuss preventive wellness options thoroughly, and promptly email diagnostic updates and lab findings after appointments."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
