      "q": {
        "en": "How does the team handle anxious or fearful pets?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Pet parents report that veterinarians and technicians use gentle pacing, treats, and low-stress techniques to keep nervous dogs and cats comfortable throughout examinations."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
